        "notes": "## IMPORTANT TIP\nI recommend you to learn and use the **Flash Heal** technique when you don't need to do massive heal. It consists of staying in damage boost and very quickly use your heal beam (like a flash) right after you start to use your dash.\n\n## CORE\n- [Superflexor](item_580b77b4-0d63-469b-99a8-5372c55dfc1b): Main item that gives us [Weapon Power](stat_weapon_power) to heal and increase by **25%** our [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) everytimes we heal someone.\n\n## FILLER ITEM\n- [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da)\n- [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418) or [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf)",
